514
00:27:39,181 --> 00:27:44,320
The resulting vapor rises to the top of the tube and passes through cooling fins before

515
00:27:44,321 --> 00:27:46,580
it's released into the air.

516
00:27:46,581 --> 00:27:51,240
This keeps the nearby ground temperatures well below freezing, so the permafrost can't

517
00:27:51,241 --> 00:27:58,740
melt and gives the building a good chance to survive 50 years or more.

518
00:27:58,741 --> 00:28:01,680
But if permafrost is a challenge to build on,

519
00:28:01,681 --> 00:28:05,700
