523
00:28:13,641 --> 00:28:16,320
If they lay the pipe any closer to the permafrost,

524
00:28:16,321 --> 00:28:19,400
it could get crushed when the thaw sets in.

525
00:28:19,401 --> 00:28:24,640
That lens will fall out of there and then will create a void.

