763
00:42:40,180 --> 00:42:42,980
The filtering process is similar to that on the dredge.

764
00:42:47,000 --> 00:42:48,920
The bigger rocks get sifted out,

765
00:42:48,921 --> 00:42:52,620
while the spray bars wash the remaining dirt and sand.

766
00:42:53,460 --> 00:42:56,740
It falls through to a metal grate called a ripple board,

767
00:42:57,040 --> 00:42:59,580
which creates a whirlpool effect from the running water.

768
00:43:00,600 --> 00:43:03,000
As water flows over the grate and back to sea,

769
00:43:03,720 --> 00:43:05,460
lighter sand and dirt go with it.

770
00:43:06,440 --> 00:43:09,260
Gold is heavier, so instead it gets pulled down

771
00:43:09,261 --> 00:43:11,700
and trapped by the astroturf material below.

772
00:43:13,760 --> 00:43:17,520
Finally, Buddy carefully pans through small amounts of what's left

773
00:43:17,521 --> 00:43:22,000
in order to extract the valuable gold nuggets.

774
00:43:22,100 --> 00:43:24,560
Cleaning just one tablespoon of material

775
00:43:24,660 --> 00:43:27,400
can take him up to an hour.

776
00:43:27,500 --> 00:43:29,900
Buddy hasn't hit a huge payday yet,

777
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:33,140
but for him, searching is half the find.

778
00:43:33,240 --> 00:43:34,900
It's a hobby.

779
00:43:35,000 --> 00:43:37,540
The peace of mind that comes along with being here,

780
00:43:37,640 --> 00:43:41,040
flipping at the ocean, hearing the waves is just an honor.

781
00:43:47,520 --> 00:43:50,360
The hunt for gold is one of many opportunities

782
00:43:50,460 --> 00:43:53,860
in this extreme state that has lured people for decades.

783
00:43:55,920 --> 00:43:58,360
Though its volatile land creates challenges

784
00:43:58,460 --> 00:44:02,560
for those who live here, their innovative solutions

785
00:44:02,660 --> 00:44:06,280
prove that with a strong will and a can-do attitude,

786
00:44:06,380 --> 00:44:10,880
you can make it and thrive in our frontier state.

